@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
hide circle
hide empty members
title 第十週結束時：其實已經在「用」泛型，只是還沒「寫」過

class Mission #F4F4F4 {
  - history : <b>ArrayList<MissionStep></b>
  + getStep(index : int) : <b>MissionStep</b>
}
class MissionStep #F4F4F4 {
  + getCommand() : int
  + getEnergy() : int
  + getResult() : String
}
interface SampleSource <<interface>> #F4F4F4 {
  + getSamples() : int
}
abstract class Rover <<abstract>> #F4F4F4
class HeavyRover #F4F4F4 {
  + getDrillCount() : int
}
class SampleTray #F4F4F4
class SampleReport #F4F4F4 {
  + {static} print(String, SampleSource)
  + {static} print(String, Rover)
  + {static} print(String, int)
}
Mission o--> "0..*" MissionStep : 日誌
SampleSource <|.. Rover
SampleSource <|.. SampleTray
Rover <|-- HeavyRover
SampleReport ..> SampleSource
SampleReport ..> Rover
note right of Mission
  get 取出時，編譯器<b>已知道</b>是 MissionStep；
  add 一個 String 會在<b>編譯時</b>被拒絕。
  → 本週問題：我們自己寫的類別，
     能不能也做到這件事？
end note
note bottom of SampleTray
  地面站新需求：把<b>樣本盒</b>、<b>重型車</b>、
  <b>混合來源</b>分別成組，統計總樣本數，
  取回時還要保留具體型態
end note
@enduml
